        "problem": "If $|A|=3$ then $|P(P(A))|=$",
        "worked_solution": "For any set $S$, we have $|P(S)|={2}^{|S|}.$ \n\nIn our case, we have $|A|=3.$ Therefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n|P(A)|={2}^{3}=8.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|P(P(A))| & ={2}^{|P(A)|} \\\\  & ={2}^{8} \\\\  & =256.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
